+  ///
+  /// |window_id| names the window the browser is a tab of. It must be greater
+  /// than zero, and should not collide with the ids of other windows or tabs
+  /// (use large values, for example above 16777216). All browsers with the
+  /// same |window_id| are the tabs of one window, in the order of their first
